import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 178 | Elastic Entry · Sacred-Cultivation Four Realms Cross-Boundary Ascension and Plane Transcendent Four-Dimensional Assessment Linkage","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 178 | Elastic Entry · Sacred-Cultivation Four Realms Cross-Boundary Ascension and Plane Transcendent Four-Dimensional Assessment Linkage","no":178,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Sacred-Cultivation Four Realms","Cross-Boundary Ascension","Four-Dimensional Assessment","Elastic Entry","Linkage"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","17-Plane Transcendent Standard","23-20% Activation Strategy"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0178_模块1-弹性篇-圣修四境跨境跃迁与四维考核联动.md","filePath":"en/0178_模块1-弹性篇-圣修四境跨境跃迁与四维考核联动.md"}'),o={name:"en/0178_模块1-弹性篇-圣修四境跨境跃迁与四维考核联动.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,c,d){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-178-elastic-entry-sacred-cultivation-four-realms-cross-boundary-ascension-and-plane-transcendent-four-dimensional-assessment-linkage" tabindex="-1">Entry 178 | Elastic Entry: Sacred-Cultivation Four Realms Cross-Boundary Ascension and Plane Transcendent Four-Dimensional Assessment Linkage <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-178-elastic-entry-sacred-cultivation-four-realms-cross-boundary-ascension-and-plane-transcendent-four-dimensional-assessment-linkage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 178 | Elastic Entry: Sacred-Cultivation Four Realms Cross-Boundary Ascension and Plane Transcendent Four-Dimensional Assessment Linkage&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement (Elastic Entry) | Baseline references: Documents 14, 17, 23</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-stringing-the-sacred-cultivation-four-realms-into-a-gradeable-uphill-road" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Stringing the sacred-cultivation four realms into a &quot;gradeable uphill road&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-stringing-the-sacred-cultivation-four-realms-into-a-gradeable-uphill-road" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Stringing the sacred-cultivation four realms into a &quot;gradeable uphill road&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This entry is Module 1&#39;s elastic convergence entry at the sacred-cultivation four realms. Previous entries 143–177 already unfolded the four realms of Boundary-Breaking/World-Creation/Origin/Multiverse, seven categories per realm; this entry does not add a new path, but connects the sacred-cultivation four realms&#39; cross-boundary ascension relations with the Plane Transcendent four-dimensional assessment (power 40 / mind 25 / contribution 20 / responsibility 15) into one linkage table, answering a question running through this whole batch: when a cultivator walks from Boundary-Breaking all the way to Multiverse, what is every step actually accumulating for &quot;becoming a Plane Transcendent&quot;?</p><p>At this moment the six top-level axioms running through all 36 entries must be restated — the anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, and law-first axiom. The sacred-cultivation four realms are &quot;sacred&quot; not &quot;mortal&quot; precisely because they for the first time bind individual evolution with cosmic public responsibility; the four-dimensional assessment only settles accounts at the Origin Realm precisely because it requires &quot;power, mind, contribution, responsibility&quot; to accumulate synchronously with every cross-boundary ascension, not last-minute cramming at the top. The law-first axiom ensures this linkage table is self-consistent and never rewritten; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-sacred-cultivation-four-realms-cross-boundary-ascension-chain" tabindex="-1">I. The Sacred-Cultivation Four Realms&#39; Cross-Boundary Ascension Chain <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-sacred-cultivation-four-realms-cross-boundary-ascension-chain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Sacred-Cultivation Four Realms&#39; Cross-Boundary Ascension Chain&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14) and this batch&#39;s entries, the sacred-cultivation four realms constitute a progressively amplifying cross-boundary ascension chain:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Ascension</th><th>From→To</th><th>Essence of Ascension</th><th>Change in Power Scale</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>First leap</td><td>Boundary-Breaking→World-Creation</td><td>From &quot;walking across planes&quot; to &quot;creating a complete world&quot;</td><td>From plane operation rights to world design rights</td></tr><tr><td>Second leap</td><td>World-Creation→Origin</td><td>From &quot;creating a small world&quot; to &quot;participating in cosmic origin fine-tuning&quot;</td><td>From world scale to cosmic scale</td></tr><tr><td>Third leap</td><td>Origin→Multiverse</td><td>From &quot;guarding one cosmos&quot; to &quot;connecting multiple cosmoses&#39; origins&quot;</td><td>From single cosmos to multiple cosmoses</td></tr><tr><td>(Extension)</td><td>Multiverse→Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse</td><td>From &quot;connecting multiple cosmoses&quot; to &quot;permanent cornerstone of the Myriad Races origin balanced-anchor network&quot;</td><td>From multiple cosmoses to the whole network</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Every leap is not &quot;numbers getting bigger,&quot; but <strong>the scope of responsibility objects widening</strong>. The five mortal-cultivation realms&#39; responsibility objects are mainly oneself; the sacred-cultivation four realms&#39; responsibility objects progressively expand to planes, worlds, cosmoses, multiple cosmoses, the whole network.</p><h2 id="ii-how-the-four-dimensional-assessment-accumulates-with-cross-boundary-ascension" tabindex="-1">II. How the Four-Dimensional Assessment Accumulates with Cross-Boundary Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-how-the-four-dimensional-assessment-accumulates-with-cross-boundary-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. How the Four-Dimensional Assessment Accumulates with Cross-Boundary Ascension&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per the Plane Transcendent Standard (Document 17), the four-dimensional assessment is not calculated once at the Origin Realm, but accumulates at every leap of the sacred-cultivation four realms:</p><ul><li><strong>Power dimension (40%)</strong>: Boundary-Breaking accumulates cross-plane operation power, World-Creation accumulates world design power, Origin accumulates cosmic origin mobilization power, Multiverse accumulates multi-cosmos governance power — every leap adds a brick to &quot;power dimension meeting standard&quot;</li><li><strong>Mind dimension (25%)</strong>: Boundary-Breaking tests &quot;crossing boundaries not harvesting,&quot; World-Creation tests &quot;creating not authoritarian,&quot; Origin tests &quot;holding power not authoritatively deciding,&quot; Multiverse tests &quot;connecting not swallowing&quot; — every leap is an additional mind exam</li><li><strong>Contribution dimension (20%)</strong>: Boundary-Breaking builds roads, World-Creation builds public world fields, Origin does law optimization, Multiverse builds cross-cosmos networks — every leap accumulates civilizational-level contribution records</li><li><strong>Responsibility dimension (15%)</strong>: Boundary-Breaking bears plane transportation responsibility, World-Creation bears world-guarding responsibility, Origin bears 30% public obligation, Multiverse bears cross-cosmos hub responsibility — every leap increases public responsibility</li></ul><p>In other words: <strong>the Plane Transcendent four-dimensional assessment is essentially the final settlement of accumulated values from every leap of the sacred-cultivation four realms</strong>. A person discovering at the Origin Realm that mind or responsibility is not met has root causes already planted in the Boundary-Breaking and World-Creation leaps.</p><h2 id="iii-linkage-key-points-of-cross-boundary-ascension" tabindex="-1">III. &quot;Linkage&quot; Key Points of Cross-Boundary Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-linkage-key-points-of-cross-boundary-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. &quot;Linkage&quot; Key Points of Cross-Boundary Ascension&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This linkage table has three key designs:</p><ol><li><strong>No skipping-level backfilling allowed</strong>: mind and responsibility cannot be ignored just because power is great — authoritarian tendencies planted in Boundary-Breaking will be dug out by consciousness deep scan when settling accounts at the Origin Realm</li><li><strong>Every leap leaves traces</strong>: every leap&#39;s assessment data is relayed back to the Alaya Network, forming the cultivator&#39;s &quot;responsibility growth file,&quot; directly called by the four-dimensional assessment</li><li><strong>Cross-genealogy universal</strong>: no matter humans, wood tribe, number tribe, thought tribe, or planetary consciousness, same linkage table, same four-dimensional weights — unified standard, ten thousand paths</li></ol><h2 id="iv-essential-difference-from-the-five-mortal-cultivation-realms" tabindex="-1">IV. Essential Difference from the Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-essential-difference-from-the-five-mortal-cultivation-realms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Essential Difference from the Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This entry again points out the essential difference repeatedly emphasized in this batch: the five mortal-cultivation realms (Sense Origin to Dao Origin) are mainly &quot;inwardly polishing oneself,&quot; assessment centered on personal cultivation; the sacred-cultivation four realms are &quot;outwardly bearing public responsibility,&quot; assessment embedded with four dimensions from the start — power is only the entry ticket, mind, contribution, and responsibility are the real threshold for &quot;crossing boundaries.&quot; This is precisely &quot;both virtue and talent, virtue first&quot; landing in realm institutions.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: counting every leap&#39;s accumulated values into the four-dimensional assessment, avoiding rework of &quot;reaching the top only to find not met&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the mind dimension tests &quot;not harvesting, not authoritarian, not authoritatively deciding, not swallowing&quot; at every leap, predatory tendencies exposed early and corrected early</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: old-system strong ones got skipping levels without assessment; Heng Yuan Zhou sacred-cultivation four realms leave traces every leap, four-dimension accumulation, final settlement</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the linkage table is universal to five genealogies, planetary consciousness, and Youth Supremes, unified standard</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the linkage table and four-dimensional assessment framework are network-public, Myriad Races jointly reference and jointly supervise</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The sacred-cultivation four realms&#39; cross-boundary ascension is not an uphill road only comparing who runs fastest, but a staircase where &quot;power and responsibility must grow synchronously.&quot; The Plane Transcendent four-dimensional assessment is the growth account silently recorded at every step of this staircase. With this linkage table connected, &quot;Boundary-Breaking—World-Creation—Origin—Multiverse&quot; is no longer four isolated realm nouns, but a clearly gradeable, supervisable, recalculatable path to sainthood — the road&#39;s end is not one person&#39;s god-throne, but a never-off-post cornerstone on the Myriad Races origin balanced-anchor network.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a> · <a href="./23-20%激活战略规划.html">23-20% Activation Strategy</a> · <a href="./21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operation Principle</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{h as __pageData,g as default};
